msgid "`errno` and `libc_errno` in LLVM-libc"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/errno.md:5
msgid ""
"Many C and POSIX functions report errors by setting `errno`. Because LLVM-"
"libc supports multiple build and deployment modes ({doc}`../"
"full_host_build`, {doc}`../full_cross_build`, {doc}`../overlay_mode`, "
"baremetal, GPU, and header-only `libc/shared/`), internal code and unit "
"tests access `errno` through `libc_errno`."
